index b081d6d..8509988 100644
--- a/addons/resource.language.en_gb/resources/strings.po
+++ b/addons/resource.language.en_gb/resources/strings.po
@@ -26643,7 +26643,7 @@ msgstr ""
 #. Hades: help of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvtransport"; translated in Estuary (#52001)
 #: system/settings/settings.xml
 msgctxt "#59895"
-msgid "For experts. How native Dolby Vision is sent to the TV. As composed, the default: the picture the composer of ETSI GS CCM 001 builds, exactly as it is, in the colour representation the video describes (YCbCr, or IPT for profile 5). As licensed players send (IPT): profiles 7 and 8 converted to IPT-PQ-c2, as licensed players are reported to send them (where a graphics chip cannot keep up, it goes out as composed). It measured a little less faithful: the TV gives the right pixel of each pair the colour worked out for the left one, which shows where the light changes sharply inside a strong colour. Converted to BT.2020: the picture is rebuilt in RGB and converted to BT.2020 YCbCr, as earlier builds sent it, to compare on a display. Menus or subtitles drawn over the video are converted into the representation that is sent. What the step-down finds is not kept while Converted to BT.2020 is chosen. Takes effect from the next video."
+msgid "For experts. How native Dolby Vision is sent to the TV. As composed, the default: the picture the composer of ETSI GS CCM 001 builds, exactly as it is, in the colour representation the video describes (YCbCr, or IPT for profile 5). As licensed players send (IPT): every profile in IPT-PQ-c2 with the matrices that licensed set-top boxes send, byte for byte (profiles 7 and 8 converted, profile 5 taken from the matrices of its video to those) (where a graphics chip cannot keep up, it goes out as composed). It measured a little less faithful: the TV gives the right pixel of each pair the colour worked out for the left one, which shows where the light changes sharply inside a strong colour. Converted to BT.2020: the picture is rebuilt in RGB and converted to BT.2020 YCbCr, as earlier builds sent it, to compare on a display. Menus or subtitles drawn over the video are converted into the representation that is sent. What the step-down finds is not kept while Converted to BT.2020 is chosen. Takes effect from the next video."
 msgstr ""
 
